  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your power as a witch allows you to gain arcane focus in an instant.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Witch level 4th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use a swift action to gain arcane focus after utilizing a hex. You may use this ability three times per day.</p>\n<p>You add 1 point to your arcane pool.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
